cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "bgvars: Bayesian Inference of Global Vector Autoregressive and Global Vector Error Correction Models"
abstract: >-
  bgvars is an R package that assists in the set-up and inference of Bayesian
  global vector autoregressive (BGVAR) and global vector error correction
  (BGVEC) models. It covers the preparation of country-specific data and weight
  matrices, the specification and estimation of country sub-models, their
  combination into a solved global model, and the evaluation of the result by
  means of forecasts, generalised impulse responses and forecast error variance
  decompositions.
